<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>纽约时报 &amp;gt; 美国 &amp;gt; 政治</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/spotlight/on-politics</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 21:00:03 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>现在是特朗普的首都，但选民并不住在那里</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/28/us/politics/trump-washington-dc-capital-voters.html</link><description>他对重塑华盛顿的痴迷可能会在政治上损害他的政党。</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 21:00:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/28/us/politics/trump-washington-dc-capital-voters.html</guid></item><item><title>特朗普如何将格雷厄姆家族王朝纳入自己的王朝</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/us/politics/trump-lindsey-graham-darline-graham.html</link><description>总统将林赛和达林·格雷厄姆视为他自己政治遗产的一部分。</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 15:48:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/us/politics/trump-lindsey-graham-darline-graham.html</guid></item><item><title>特朗普在南卡罗来纳州参议院决选中对达林·格雷厄姆的支持是否足够？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/trump-darline-graham-south-carolina-runoff.html</link><description>总统在一位参议员的妹妹身上下了很大的赌注。</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 21:39:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/trump-darline-graham-south-carolina-runoff.html</guid></item><item><title>美国结束了闪电般的初选和政治快速约会的夏季</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/21/us/politics/midterm-primaries-south-carolina-wisconsin-michigan.html</link><description>几个州的情节曲折导致了快速的比赛，与传统的美国马拉松比赛相比，这些比赛感觉更让人想起欧洲式的快速比赛。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:17:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/21/us/politics/midterm-primaries-south-carolina-wisconsin-michigan.html</guid></item><item><title>更多特朗普选择的候选人在共和党初选中失利</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/19/us/politics/trump-primary-election-republican-endorsements.html</link><description>最近的一系列失利削弱了总统的获胜记录，引发了人们对他对党选民的控制力的新质疑。</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 20:20:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/19/us/politics/trump-primary-election-republican-endorsements.html</guid></item><item><title>佛罗里达州取代拜伦·唐纳德斯的竞选以已经竞选国会议员的候选人为特色</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/17/us/politics/florida-byron-donalds-election.html</link><description>我们来看看拜伦·唐纳德的替代者竞争激烈。</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:48:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/17/us/politics/florida-byron-donalds-election.html</guid></item><item><title>参议员埃德·马基的进步政治能否帮助他克服年龄问题？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/14/us/politics/ed-markey-senator-age.html</link><description>埃德·马基希望他的进步政治能够拯救他在马萨诸塞州。</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 23:08:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/14/us/politics/ed-markey-senator-age.html</guid></item><item><title>进步派惨遭失败后，民主党面临的三个问题</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/12/us/politics/david-crowley-francesca-hong-democrats-wisconsin.html</link><description>关键战场上的民主党选民正表现出激烈的分裂。从现在到 2028 年，该党有很多事情需要讨论。</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 18:36:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/12/us/politics/david-crowley-francesca-hong-democrats-wisconsin.html</guid></item><item><title>威斯康星州州长民主党初选的过山车般的结束</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/10/us/politics/francesca-hong-wisconsin-democratic-primary.html</link><description>民主党似乎有可能提名一位民主社会主义者担任州长。他们是怎么来到这里的？</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 21:44:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/10/us/politics/francesca-hong-wisconsin-democratic-primary.html</guid></item><item><title>他们是久经考验的民主党人。选民关心吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/07/us/politics/angie-craig-haley-stevens-democrats.html</link><description>2018 年，海莉·史蒂文斯 (Haley Stevens) 和安吉·克雷格 (Angie Craig) 受到民主党人的赞扬。今年，他们面临着艰难的初选。</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 22:29:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/07/us/politics/angie-craig-haley-stevens-democrats.html</guid></item></channel></rss>